htenment-a-fan-writeup\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/876310-mystery-enlightenment-a-fan-writeup\"> Mystery Enlightenment: A fan writeup - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/876310-mystery-enlightenment-a-fan-writeup\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/876310-mystery-enlightenment-a-fan-writeup </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Mystery Enlightenment Sometimes the coils aren't enough for one dragon or another. Sometimes they're tired of frenzying at all, even if they are more powerful for mastering the coil of the wyrm. Sometimes they simply fail to see why they shouldn't be able to replicate Dracula's defeat of the sun, after all Dracula for all his exceptional nature was still fundamentally kindred. When a Dragon pushes the coils too far, when their want becomes need and need becomes obsession... Most of the time, bad things happen. Spectacular explosions, dark creatures flocking to the individual and devouring them. An </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2532-blitzkitty","name":"BlitzKitty","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2532_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"72"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T14:31:16-07:00","id":878097,"title":"","content":"I'd like to add my new Salubri done as PenDragon's 'Bloodlines as Cla